Price |  |\n\n## About Rustomjee Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B\n\nGracing the skyline of Malad, Adarsh Regal combines modern day luxuries with a peaceful ambience. Nestled in the picturesque haven of Adarsh Vihar complex, each 2 & 3.5 BHK flat offers you the perfect [...read more](javascript:void(0);)\n\n### About Rustomjee Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B\n\nAbout Rustomjee Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B\n\nGracing the skyline of Malad, Adarsh Regal combines modern day luxuries with a peaceful ambience. Nestled in the picturesque haven of Adarsh Vihar complex, each 2 & 3.5 BHK flat offers you the perfect harmony of space, light and ventilation. Adarsh Vihar - A self sufficient township situated in Malad (West), Adarsh Vihar Complex is a peaceful sanctum, which is designed to offer you a lifetime of relaxed undisturbed living.\n\n## Specifications\n\n* Walls\n\n  + Exterior Acrylic Paint\n* Others\n\n  + Windows Powder Coated Aluminium Sliding\n* Flooring\n\n  + Toilets Ceramic Tiles\n  + Living/Dining Vitrified Tiles\n* Fittings\n\n  + Kitchen Granite Platform with Stainless Steel Sink\n  + Toilets Sanitary Fittings\n\n## Amenities\n\n* ![Intercom](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/aminities/intercom.jpg)\n\n  Intercom\n\n## Image Gallery of this Project\n\n![](https://dynamic.realestateindia.com/proj_images/wh3/project18183/proj_header_image-18183.jpg)\n\n## Location Map of Rustomjee Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B\n\n## About Rustomjee\n\nAs a developer, Rustomjee has always believed that form follows function. This is evident in every aspect of our design and the way we plan homes. Rustomjee also lays special emphasis on the quality o [...Read more](javascript:void(0);)\n\n### About Rustomjee\n\nAbout Rustomjee\n\nAs a developer, Rustomjee has always believed that form follows function. This is evident in every aspect of our design and the way we plan homes. Rustomjee also lays special emphasis on the quality of its homes and expects everyone in the team to follow the rule of 'Better, not cheaper'. We realise that buying of a home is more than just a transaction; it is the realisation of an important dream. Which is why, customer-centricity is the very essence of our brand DNA and the many satisfied customers we've had bear testimony to this fact. Rustomjee also believes in giving back to the society within which we function and our education initiatives are one of many steps we’ve taken in this direction. By identifying potential, giving everyone equal opportunity and nurturing talent, we’re helping create the next generation of leaders. Since we set out on this journey, we have transformed 10 million square feet of the city into premium townships, corporate parks, retail spaces and over 8,500 homes. In the last five years alone, we’ve delivered 8 million square feet of construction area, with a special focus on the Mumbai Metropolitan Region.\n\n702 Natraj, M. V. Road Junction, Western Express Highway, Andheri East, Mumbai, Maharashtra\n\n![](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/images/lazy-load-image.jpg)\n\n## Other Projects of this Builder\n\n![](https://dynamic.realestateindia.com/proj_images/project879/proj_img-879_1-350x350.jpg)\n\nElanza\n\n[Prestigious Apartments](https://www.realestateindia.com/projects/rustomjee-elanza-mumbai/)\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n2.45 Cr.-5.81 Cr.\n\n1100-2610 /Sq.ft.\n\n2, 3, 4 BHK Apartment\n\n![](https://dynamic.realestateindia.com/proj_images/project2263/proj_img-2263_1-350x350.jpg)\n\nRustomjee Global City\n\n[1/2/3/4 BHK Apartments](https://www.realestateindia.com/projects/rustomjee-global-city-by-rustomjee-in-mumbai/)\n\nVirar West, Mumbai\n\n29 Lac-35 Lac\n\n650-750 /Sq.ft.\n\n1, 2 BHK Apartment\n\n![](https://dynamic.realestateindia.com/proj_images/project4890/proj_img-4890_1-350x350.jpg)\n\nRustomjee Elements\n\n[3/4/5 BHK Apartments](https://www.realestateindia.com/projects/rustomjee-elements-by-rustomjee-in-juhu-mumbai/)\n\nJuhu, Mumbai\n\n12 Cr.\n\n1960-2902 /Sq.ft.\n\n3, 4, 5 BHK