ts.htm \"Projects in Pune\")\n  + [New Projects in Noida](https://www.realestateindia.com/noida-property/residential-projects.htm \"Projects in Noida\")\n  + [New Projects in Lucknow](https://www.realestateindia.com/lucknow-property/residential-projects.htm \"Projects in Lucknow\")\n  + [New Projects in Ghaziabad](https://www.realestateindia.com/ghaziabad-property/residential-projects.htm \"Projects in Ghaziabad\")\n  + [New Projects in Navi Mumbai](https://www.realestateindia.com/navimumbai-property/residential-projects.htm \"Projects in Navi Mumbai\")\n  + [New Projects in Greater Noida](https://www.realestateindia.com/greaternoida-property/residential-projects.htm \"Projects in Greater Noida\")\n  + [New Projects in Chennai](https://www.realestateindia.com/chennai-property/residential-projects.htm \"Projects in Chennai\")\n  + [New Projects in Thane](https://www.realestateindia.com/thane-property/residential-projects.htm \"Projects in Thane\")\n  + [New Projects in Ahmedabad](https://www.realestateindia.com/ahmedabad-property/residential-projects.htm \"Projects in Ahmedabad\")\n  + [New Projects in Jaipur](https://www.realestateindia.com/jaipur-property/residential-projects.htm \"Projects in Jaipur\")\n  + [New Projects in Hyderabad](https://www.realestateindia.com/hyderabad-property/residential-projects.htm \"Projects in Hyderabad\")\n\n ","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/rustomjee-adarsh-regal-b/25844/project","title":"Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B, Kandivali West, Mumbai - Price on Request","raw_content":"![Squareyards Logo](/assets/images/squareyards.png?aio=w-82;h-32;crop;)\n![Rustomjee developer logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/rustomjee-599.jpg?aio=w-128;h-128;crop;)\n\n# Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n![Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B Cover Image](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/rustomjee-adarsh-regal-b-project-project-large-image2.jpg?aio=w-725;h-350;crop;)\n![Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B Tower View](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/rustomjee-adarsh-regal-b-project-tower-view1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B Video](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-rustomjee-adarsh-regal-b-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\n**Price on Request**\n\n## About Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B, Kandivali West by Rustomjee\n\n## Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B Price List, Price Trends and Market Insights\n\n### Price List\n\nView the latest price list for Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B.\n\n| Unit Type (Saleable) | Price\\* | Action |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  700 Sq. Ft. | **Price on Request** | Check Availability |\n\n\\*Prices are indicative and subject to applicable charges and project terms.\n\n### Price Trends\n\nRustomjee Adarsh Regal B's average asking price is stable quarter-on-quarter, compared with Kandivali West.\n\nSep 2025 — Jun 2026\n\n| Quarter | Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B | Kandivali West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Jun 2026 | 36350 | 27000 |\n| Mar 2026 | 36200 | 25100 |\n| Dec 2025 | 36800 | 25750 |\n| Sep 2025 | 0 | 27100 |\n\n### Comparable Projects\n\nRustomjee Adarsh Regal B avg. price is ₹ 36.4 K/Sq.Ft. compared to Kandivali West at ₹ 27 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Project | Avg. ₹/sq ft |\n| --- | --- |\n| Current Project **Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B** | ₹ 36,350 |\n| [Lodha Woods](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/lodha-woods/112847/project \"Lodha Woods\") | ₹ 33,050 |\n| [Chandak 34 Park Estate](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/chandak-34-park-estate/100855/project \"Chandak 34 Park Estate\") | ₹ 31,550 |\n| Kandivali West | ₹ 27,000 |\n| [Shapoorji Pallonji Sarova](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/shapoorji-pallonji-sarova/10427/project \"Shapoorji Pallonji Sarova\") | ₹ 26,250 |\n\n### Rentals\n\nMonthly Rent in Kandivali West ranges from ₹ 24.2 K to ₹ 75.6 K with options available for STUDIO,1,2,3 BHK units\n\n| Configuration | In Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B | In Kandivali West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK | - | ₹ 35 K |\n| 2 BHK | - | ₹ 49.5 K |\n| 3 BHK | - | ₹ 75.6 K |\n\n### Recent Updates\n\nGet the latest price and market updates for Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B.\n\n#### MMRDA Plans Two New Ring Roads to Ease Mumbai Traffic\n\nThe Mumbai Metropolitan Region Development Authority (MMRDA) is planning two additional ring routes, expanding its proposed network from seven to nine. These new corridors will cover approximately 307 km and will connect existing roads and planned projects across Mumbai, Thane, and Navi Mumbai.\n\n#### New Road Link Approved to Enhance Mumbai Connectivity\n\nThe Maharashtra government has approved a ₹1,722 crore road link project aimed at connecting the Versova-Bandra Sea Link with the Mumbai Coastal Road. This infrastructure development is expected to significantly improve traffic flow, reduce commuting times across the city.\n\nDuring Q2'2026, average property prices for Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B moved from ₹ 36,200/sqft to ₹ 36,350/sqft, reflecting a 0.41% rise.\n\n#### MMRDA Presents Surplus Budget with Significant Allocation for Infrastructure\n\nMMRDA has presented a surplus budget of ₹48,072 crore, with 87% allocated to infrastructure projects, including roads, public transport, and urban development. A notable provision of ₹4,000 crore is earmarked for the development of Mumbai 3.0 New Town, aiming for planned urban expansion.\n\n#### Goregaon-Mulund Link Road Project Receives ₹2,650 Crore in BMC Budget\n\nThe Goregaon-Mulund Link Road project has been allocated ₹2,650 crore in the BMC's FY26-27 budget. This crucial east-west connectivity project, which involves the construction of a 4.7 km twin-tube tunnel under the Sanjay Gandhi National Park, aims to ease traffic congestion on the Ghodbunder Road.\n\n#### BMC Budget Includes ₹6,475 Crore for Water Security Projects\n\nThe BMC's FY26-27 budget includes a substantial allocation of ₹6,475 crore for water security initiatives. This funding is designated for projects such as the Manori desalination plant (₹500 crore) and the Gargai project (₹437.51 crore), aimed at augmenting the city's water supply capacity.\n\n#### Mumbai-Pune Expressway 'Missing Link' Project Set for May 1 Inauguration, Promising Safer and Faster Travel\n\nThe highly anticipated 'Missing Link' project on the Mumbai-Pune Expressway is set to be inaugurated on May 1, significantly reducing travel time by approximately 30 minutes and enhancing safety. The 10.5-km stretch features tunnels and a bridge, bypassing the accident-prone Khandala Ghat. This infrastructure upgrade is expected to ease traffic congestion, improve travel safety.\n\n#### Mumbai Local Trains Face Cancellations for Infrastructure Upgrade\n\nWestern Railway is undertaking essential infrastructure upgrades between Kandivali and Borivali from December 21, 2025, to January 18, 2026, leading to the daily cancellation of over 80 local trains. This includes work on tracks and crossovers, impacting suburban, passenger, and express train services. Nightly mega blocks are also in effect, causing further service disruptions.\n\nDuring Q4'2025, average property prices for Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B moved from ₹ 23,750/sqft to ₹ 36,800/sqft, reflecting a 54.95% rise.\n\nThe Mumbai Metropolitan Region Development Authority (MMRDA) is leasing out 68,166 square feet of retail and commercial space across stations on Metro Lines 2A and 7 to generate non-fare revenue for the financial viability of Mumbai's metro services.\n\n## Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B Floor Plans\n\n![Representative image for Floor plan of 2 BHK 700 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B, Mumbai](/assets/images/floor-plans-coming-soon.svg)\n\nPrice:Price on Request\n\n## Master Plan, Photos, Videos & Brochure of Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B\n\nExplore the master plan, project photos and walkthrough videos of Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B to understand the overall layout, tower placement, amenities, landscaped spaces and key highlights before making your buying decision.\n\nDownload master plan of Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B to explore layout details in Kandivali West, Mumbai.\n\n### Master Plan\n\nOverall project layout & design\n\n### Walkthrough Video\n\nVirtual tour of the property\n\n## Amenities & Specifications of Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B\n\n### Sports Sports\n\n![Sports](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/sports/am-ico-kidsplay-active.svg)\n\n### Convenience Convenience\n\n![Convenience](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/convenience/am-ico-powerbac-active.svg)\n\n### Safety Safety\n\n![Safety](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/safety/am-ico-24x7secu-active.svg)\n\n### Environment Environment\n\n![Environment](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/environment/am-ico-normalpa-active.svg)\n\n### Specifications\n\n## Location and Connectivity Around Rustomjee Kandivali West\n\n![Connectivity map showing nearby places around Mumbai Western Suburbs](/assets/images/project-map.png?aio=w-714;h-317;crop;)\n\nEstimate commute from your office or kid's school to Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B.\n\n![Car travel mode](/assets/images/car-fill.svg)\n![Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/rustomjee-adarsh-regal-b-project-project-large-image2.jpg?aio=w-112;h-96;crop;)\n\nPlease select the starting point to calculate the travel time.\n\n![Rolling loader icon](/assets/images/rolling-loader.gif)\n\n### Nearby Landmarks\n\n#### Kidzee Pre School\n\n#### Orlem Church\n\n#### Marve Nursing Home And Polyclinic\n\n### Connecting Roads\n\nAverage Asking Price in Kandivali West\n\nBased on active listings and recent trends\n\nWestern Express Highway and major roads\n\nLimited public transport\n\nVery good for visit Kandivali west\n\n— Rajubhau Sasane, Real estate agent\n\n## RERA Details of Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B\n\n## How does Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B compare with similar projects?\n\n![Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B project in Kandivali West, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-rustomjee-adarsh-regal-b-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/rustomjee-adarsh-regal-b/25844/project \"Rustomjee Adarsh Regal B\")\n\nKandivali West, Mumbai\n\n![Shapoorji Pallonji Epsilon project in Kandivali East, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-shapoorji-pallonji-epsilon-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Shapoorji Pallonji Epsilon](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/shapoorji-pallonji-epsilon/7398/project \"Shapoorji Pallonji Epsilon\")\n\nKandivali East, Mumbai\n\n![Shapoorji Pallonji Astron project in Kandivali East, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-shapoorji-pallonji-astron-flagshipimg1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Shapoorji Pallonji Astron](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/shapoorji-pallonji-astron/8730/project \"Shapoorji Pallonji Astron\")\n\nKandivali East, Mumbai\n\nSend one enquiry to all selected projects and compare up to 4 options side-by-side.\n\n## Rustomjee Track Record\n\n![Rustomjee logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/rustomjee-599.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n\nMumbai’s renowned developers, Rustomjee Company, is a brand that has ruled the city with exquisite architectural designs. It has delivered approximately every construction style, including housing services, retail outlets, corporate spaces and even independent houses. Found in 1996, Rustomjee builder has covered almost 30 million square feet of land in the city of dreams. \nThe developers have maintained an identity in niche infrastructure in their portfolio that counts 12 million square feet of land with completed projects and 15 million square feet of land with under-construction projects. Besides this, the other 30 million square feet is the projects which are yet in the pipeline. \nCurrently, this giant developer only owns the biggest township in Mumbai. Apart from this, there are localities where they build hospitals and educational institutes in the most potential localities in the town. Namely, Rustomjee Developers have a good command of projects in Upper Juhu, BKC Annex,  Kandivali, Khar, Borivali, Virar and Thane. \nBesides this, Rustomjee real estate has a notion of bringing a child-friendly environment to the buyers with the perfect blend of peace, style and comfort. All their projects grant personalised living experiences with effective spacing. Moreover, they also ensure quality construction qualities with family-welcoming zones.\n\n![Rustomjee Ozone Skye residential project in Goregaon West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-rustomjee-ozone-skye-project-flagship-opt-86d0b5d1-ea30-48ec-8de6-681535ff0790.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nGoregaon West, Mumbai\n\n2, 3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 2.63 Cr to 3.81 Cr\n\n![Rustomjee Vista Bay residential project in Parel](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-rustomjee-vista-bay-project-flagship-opt-1e010c55-e7ea-45cd-9402-84d25d8255ea.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nParel, Mumbai\n\n2, 3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 3.75 Cr to 6.49 Cr\n\n![Rustomjee Thirty3.15 residential project in Bandra West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-rustomjee-thirty3.15-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nBandra West, Mumbai\n\nOffice Space\n\n₹ 4.56 Cr to 11.81 Cr\n\n![Rustomjee Bandstand Cama residential project in Bandra West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-rustomjee-bandstand-ca