 your own data\n\nResale\n\n₹27,000/sq.ft\n\nmedian · 55 listings\n\nRent\n\n₹78.1/sq.ft/mo\n\n2 BHK ~₹65,000/mo\n\nGross rental yield\n\n3.5% / yr\n\nrent vs resale value\n\nGovernment circle rate here is **₹12,686/sq.ft** — the market trades **113% above** the official rate. [Ready reckoner rates ›](/ready-reckoner-rates-mumbai)\n\nMedians from MPE listings over the last 18 months. [See the Mumbai price index ›](/mumbai-property-price-index)\n\nMPE insight\n\nTiming can matter as much as location\n\nMumbai is supply-constrained, so the best pricing and unit choice often go early — well before the launch advertising. If you’re serious about a project, it pays to know where it is in its cycle. [Read the guide ›](/guides/mumbai-real-estate-timing-and-early-access)\n\n[Ask MPE on WhatsApp](https://wa.me/919820067525?text=Hi%20MPE%2C%20I%20am%20considering%20Regal%20B%20in%20Malad%20West.%20Where%20is%20it%20in%20its%20cycle%2C%20and%20what%20are%20the%20best%20options%20right%20now%3F)\n\n## Building description\n\n### Building details\n\nRegal B comprises of 2bhk and 2 1/2 bhk apartments with all the possible amenities.\n\n### About the building\n\nThe approximate rate for 2bhk would be 85 Lac to 90 Lac and 21/2 bhk is 1 Cr.\n\n### 📈 Rate history\n\nEarly quoted rates for this building (historic), from MPE’s own records:\n\n| Year | Rate (₹/sqft) |\n| --- | --- |\n| 2006 | ₹5,000 |\n| 2007 | ₹6,500 |\n\nToday, resale in Malad West trades around **₹27,000/sq.ft** (area median) — see the price panel above.\n\n### 🗺️ Proximity & Distances\n\n✈️\n\nAirport\n\n45 min\n\n🚆\n\nRailway Station\n\n15 min\n\n### Building ratings\n\n3.5\n\n★ ★ ★ ☆ ☆\n\nBuilding\n\n4.0\n\n★ ★ ★ ★ ☆\n\nLocation\n\n4.0\n\n★ ★ ★ ★ ☆\n\nAmenities\n\n4.0\n\n★ ★ ★ ★ ☆\n\nLegal\n\n4.0\n\n★ ★ ★ ★ ☆\n\nValue for Money\n\n### 📈 Price History\n\n12/23/2006 - Rs.5000/-   \n 4/2/2007 - Rs.5500/-   \n 5/22/2007 - Rs.6000/-   \n 11/28/2007 - Rs.6500/-\n\n## Rustomjee\n\n**Developer:** [Rustomjee](/projects-in-